  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the lamb chunks and cook until browned on all sides, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the sliced kabanos and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chopped aji amarillo peppers, turmeric, cumin, salt, and pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 1 1/2 hours, or until the lamb is tender.",
    "Serve the seco de cordero on a slate tile, garnished with chopped fresh cilantro, if desired."
